 "result_note": "label by the retrain policy bar, which is defined on clean validation: V1 has 104.8% and V2 11.2% (K=1) or 13.0% (K=2) more overall MSE than the production configuration. On the perturbed validation copy both variants are far better than the production configuration (overall MSE 63.9% lower for V1, 68.0% lower for V2 K=1); the policy has no bar for that set, so this is recorded and left to the owner.",
